{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"瑜伽師地論菩薩地校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"一.是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"二.譯校凡用七種異本。（一）梵文本菩薩地．住品地品．校註略稱梵本。（二）藏文本","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"勝友等譯瑜伽行地中菩薩地．全文二十二卷．略稱藏本。（三）北涼曇無讖譯菩","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"薩地持經．十卷．略稱地持。（四）劉宋求那跋摩譯菩薩善戒經．九卷．略稱善戒。〈以","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"上三種異譯〉（五）藏文本燃燈智等譯德光造菩薩地(初九品)釋．七卷．略稱德光","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"釋。（六）藏文本智鎧等譯德光造菩薩戒品釋．一卷．略稱同上。（七）藏文本勝友","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"智鎧等譯勝子造菩薩戒品大疏．一卷．略稱勝子疏。〈以上三種註釋〉","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"三.譯校對勘凡有三事。（一）品目．諸本立名次第歧異者．皆註出曰．某本某品第幾。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"同者不註。（二）文句．諸本詳略具缺不同者．皆註出曰．某本雲雲。（三）意義．諸本","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"譯義較爲明暢正確者．註出曰．勘某本雲雲。註書解釋可資參證者．亦註出曰．某","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"釋雲雲。因此對勘而見今譯未愜者．幷加按語曰．今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"四.刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對校麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"五.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（一）梵文本菩薩地住品地品．Bodhisattvabhu^mi,ChapitresViha^raetBhu^mi.","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"與十地經Das/abhu^mikasu^tra合本．蘭都氏J．Rahder校刊．一九二六年．巴","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"黎版。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（二）藏文本瑜伽行地中菩薩地．rnal-h!byorspyod-pah!isa-lasbyan%-chubsems-","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"dpah!isa．德格版．丹珠經解部．wi字函全函。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（三）菩薩地持經．","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（四）菩薩善戒經．以上二種金陵刻經處刊會譯本。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（五）藏文本德光菩薩地釋．byan%-chubsems-dpah!isah!ih!grel-pa．德格版．丹珠","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"經解部．h!i字函一四五頁下至一八八頁下。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（六）藏文本德光菩薩戒品釋．byan%-chubsems-dpah!itshul-khams-kyileh!uh!i","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"bc#ad-pa.同函．一八八頁下至一九七頁上。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（七）藏文本勝子菩薩戒品大疏．byan%-chubsems-dpah!itshul-khrims-kyile","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"h!uh!irgya-cherh!grel-pa同函．一九七頁上至二二七頁上。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_160_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_160","text":"（八）本書南宋刻麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本校","sortOrder":28}],"overrides":{}}